      "pattern": "^og_include\\(",
      "why": "rendered output of another generated template, which escapes its own props (Latte og_include returns the HTML the included template produced)"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "^\\(?\\$?children( \\?\\? '')?\\)?$",
      "why": "slot of a primitive or organism: every `children` a generated block passes is a fragment it captured itself ({capture} / (string) $c_N, 3658 places in latte+twig blocks/); catalog blocks are rendered with ['p' => props] only (BlockRenderer::render), so `$children` is never a layout or data value (Fragment, Front and the compiled page pass props only; Layout::clean strip_tags + escapes strings and drops __html). codegen-x prints children raw on the server runtimes without a marker check (not changed in 832d7f17)"
    }
